# State migrated to the remote backend in Phase 8 Stage 0. These two lines still matter: the migration
# leaves an emptied `terraform.tfstate` and a pre-migration `terraform.tfstate.backup` on disk, and
# CLAUDE.md forbids committing .tfstate outright.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/
# `.terraform.lock.hcl` is intentionally absent from this list -- see the root .gitignore for why.
